# Yes/No Audio Classification

Digital Speech Processing - Task 1

This project uses the YESNO dataset to classify spoken Yes and No words.

Four machine learning models were tested:
- Support Vector Machine (SVM)
- Neural Network (MLP)
- Random Forest
- K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN)

Audio features were extracted using MFCCs in Python and Google Colab.

The project includes the classification code, experimental results, and report.
